    "F05_resolved": "All objects include deterministic pass/fail oracles and validation rules.",
    "F06_resolved": "Strict evidence grading hierarchy enforced, keeping unverified live claims as UNKNOWN / NOT_RUN.",
    "F07_resolved": "R03, R04, R05 specify explicit blocked-state field nullability and valid transition states."
